      "writtenOn": "2023-07-12T14:43:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wasn\u0027t able to see any difference in any GM between including this line or not. But I\u0027m guessing there are some complex clipping situations where this would make a difference. Something that complicates this is that Graphite always seems to apply AA to clip shapes, which causes a GM like clipdrawdraw is drawing incorrectly both before and after these changes. Is that something we\u0027re planning to address soon?",
      "revId": "50f40605be4b53c53179fc55dcffa148c3dca1d4",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "73b2c624_f2d86cb9",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/geom/Shape.h",
