      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-07-12T14:43:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had a couple concerns about adding this new field.\n1) Are Shapes used in performance-sensitive code where this might be a performance concern? I considered applying the outset to the shape geometry directly, but that seems a bit complicated for lines (and possibly too complicated for paths, though we might not care about those here).\n2) It feels a little weird to add this field just for clipping. But, otherwise it gets hairy passing down an outset value through various functions in ClipStack (e.g. intersects/contains) and knowing where to apply it. So I didn\u0027t have any better ideas.",
      "revId": "50f40605be4b53c53179fc55dcffa148c3dca1d4",
